      },
      {
        "node_id": "c3",
        "uuid": "a4d47b1e-b9f8-463e-bbdf-87d5a1b64826",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion shows a parallel orientation, which is consistent with a benign finding",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c4",
        "uuid": "bce00f6e-dcc9-4bdc-9953-b9aa3d98b5ee",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "There is no evidence of irregular margins, which is another characteristic of benign lesions",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c5",
        "uuid": "dd8ac478-a0b3-4de3-97b9-8731ffcc0585",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The posterior acoustic enhancement observed is not specific to a simple breast cyst and can also be seen in complex cystic and solid breast masses, making it insufficient to rule out malignancy",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c6",
        "uuid": "09780c5a-e3dc-477e-a73b-5e575eab30e0",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion's shape is described as oval, which is a characteristic of benign lesions such as simple breast cysts; however, it can also be seen in malignant masses, especially if there are additional suspicious features. The shape alone is not sufficient to exclude malignancy",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c7",
        "uuid": "f6f87eb4-57ae-4c12-a94b-ca4fe083bbc3",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The parallel orientation of the lesion does not necessarily indicate benignity; in fact, this feature can be seen in both benign and malignant masses. The orientation alone is not a definitive sign of malignancy and does not contradict the possibility of malignancy",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c8",
        "uuid": "29548391-f47f-413b-b569-8d30eec7047d",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The posterior acoustic enhancement observed is a feature commonly associated with complex cystic and solid breast masses, not solely with simple cysts. The presence of this feature, combined with the irregular margins and heterogeneous echo pattern, supports a malignancy diagnosis",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c9",
        "uuid": "fbb204c2-7973-4ae8-a062-3f246600b774",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion exhibits non-parallel orientation, which is a characteristic suggestive of malignancy",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c10",
        "uuid": "4af2a3bd-66a8-48aa-a498-aa70ffd2605b",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The evidence of interval growth, although not explicitly shown in the image, is a significant factor in the context of a complex cystic and solid breast mass. The combination of posterior acoustic enhancement, non-parallel orientation, and the possibility of interval growth strongly supports the malignancy interpretation",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c11",
